    "name": "deltaport",
    "worldSeed": "18124079587173138729",
    "prompt": "A fortified river-delta port town: a stone keep with a gatehouse and curtain walls on the bluff, a walled lower town with an inn, a bakery, market stalls and a green with a well, a busy harbor below with long piers, a three-masted galleon, a cog, and small fishing boats at anchor, a lighthouse tower on the breakwater, a graveyard with a mausoleum outside the walls, and an old mine in the pine hills whose rough rail tunnels and ore chamber connect back to the crypt beneath the keep. Meadows near town, dense pine forest on the heights.",
    "spawn": {
      "zone": "south"
    }
  },
